# Dev server restart

After **any code fix or meaningful change** in this project, **restart the app** so the running process picks up edits (Uvicorn runs with `reload=False`).

1. Stop whatever is bound to the app port (default **8000**): `lsof -ti:8000 | xargs kill -9 2>/dev/null` (or match `PORT` from `.env` if different).
2. From the repo root: `.venv/bin/python run.py` (run in the background when assisting).

Do this automatically at the end of the turn when code was modified; do not only tell the user to restart.
